{
  "_comment": [
    "THE FLEET REGISTRY. Copy to projects.json (same dir) and add one entry per project.",
    "",
    "THE SIX THINGS THE DAEMON NEEDS PER PROJECT:",
    "  id            the stable key AND the AO project name the sync filters on",
    "  root          the repo's ABSOLUTE root (where gates/ + .githooks/ + .github/ live)",
    "  owner / repo  the GitHub target",
    "  tokenEnv      the NAME of the env var holding the credential -- NEVER the bytes",
    "  worktreeRoot  where that repo's per-session git worktrees live (absolute)",
    "  store         the per-project SQLite path (absolute). ONE STORE PER PROJECT:",
    "                SQLite has one writer, so N projects on one file would contend",
    "                (SQLITE_BUSY) and share a crash domain. Per-project stores give",
    "                write isolation, failure isolation, and make the",
    "                pr:<session>:<num> id collision impossible.",
    "",
    "A BAD ENTRY IS NAMED AND SKIPPED -- it never takes the daemon down and never",
    "takes the other projects with it. `upper projects` lists what loaded and what did not.",
    "",
    "ENROLL A PROJECT:   upper enroll /abs/path <id> <owner> <repo> [TOKEN_ENV] [--dry-run]",
    "ARM ITS RULESET:    upper arm <id>        (AFTER the workflows have run once)",
    "THE FLEET VIEW:     upper projects"
  ],
  "projects": [
    {
      "id": "jarvis-upper",
      "root": "/home/leviathan/JARVIS_WORKSPACE/Shared_Workspace/JARVIS-FACTORY/jarvis-upper",
      "owner": "leviathan-devops",
      "repo": "jarvis-upper",
      "tokenEnv": "GH_TOKEN",
      "worktreeRoot": "/home/leviathan/.ao/data/worktrees/jarvis-upper",
      "store": "/home/leviathan/JARVIS_WORKSPACE/Shared_Workspace/JARVIS-FACTORY/jarvis-upper/runtime/jarvis-upper/store.sqlite"
    },
    {
      "id": "SECOND-PROJECT-EXAMPLE",
      "root": "/abs/path/to/that/project",
      "owner": "your-org",
      "repo": "your-repo",
      "tokenEnv": "THAT_PROJECTS_TOKEN",
      "worktreeRoot": "/home/leviathan/.ao/data/worktrees/your-repo",
      "store": "/abs/path/to/that/project/runtime/your-repo/store.sqlite"
    }
  ]
}
